  sequence:
  - background: {fileID: 0}
    clearBackground: 0
    speakerName: Ryuuji
    dialogue:
    - (Looks like some library books Mitsuko borrowed...)
    - (They're all way overdue... I have a feeling she forgot to bring these along
      when she went to the library...)
    - (Looks like we're in for more late return fees... Usually this means Mitsuko
      wouldn't be allowed to borrow anymore books, but she'd just go to a different
      library instead.)
    - (I guess I could just return these for her, but it'd be nice if she could practise
      a little personal responsibility every once in a while.)
